# Build context is the repo root; keep host build output and deps out of it.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/src/generated
**/*.tsbuildinfo
# Local env files (.env, .env.local, .env.production...) must never reach an image; only the example may.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
.git
design
docs
